{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/4a0bc6440d31813c00992263f4a5dc26.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=114 /></span>Embark on a thrilling freerunning journey with Supermoves, the ultimate world of parkour that has a thrilling singleplayer Career Mode, speedrunning leaderboards and a multiplayer mode where you can face off against your friends in 8 gamemodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/c31866c21a2d0abfe9a92fb2732fe045.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/c31866c21a2d0abfe9a92fb2732fe045.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/c31866c21a2d0abfe9a92fb2732fe045.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>First &amp; Third Person Immersive Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through skylines with both first &amp; third person immersive parkour mechanics. Grind on your feet across rails, trapeze on high wires, wallrun, scramble, and pull off epic backflips and frontflips on trampolines. Supermoves combines arcade elements with thrilling immersive parkour freerunning. It's like Mirror's Edge meets Tony Hawk's Pro Skater!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5d1a05d057ff0c4b07c4c9086d9283e3.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=358 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d\u2708\ufe0f <strong>Brave The World of Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The epic Supermoves Championship awaits you in 10 exotic locales. There can only be one true winner. Can you make your way to the leaderboards? When you're done speedrunning, make your own levels with the easy to use Makea Editor - or remix any level in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/ee0f052dda414492008abc02315b9089.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/ee0f052dda414492008abc02315b9089.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/ee0f052dda414492008abc02315b9089.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Face Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your friends online in heart-stopping competitions, including braving the ever-rising ball pit in Rising Tide, the brutal Sprint and Circuit, or pulse-pounding Bomb Tag. Mix and match your experience in over 8 game modes, including the fan-favorite Obstacle Course and the nostalgic Loot mode. Chain them together into a playlist-based Royale or Tournament, eliminating the opposition to declare yourself the true winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/6e2a6c6bbcaa730a784a70fb85add219.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/6e2a6c6bbcaa730a784a70fb85add219.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/6e2a6c6bbcaa730a784a70fb85add219.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc5f\ud83e\udd47 <strong>Become the Ultimate Parkour Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supermoves features a full single-player Career Mode with classic goal maps, races and tournaments. Rise as a contender in the Supermoves Parkour Championships. Complete objectives in places like the School Gym, Rooftops, Plywood Park, Flatlands, and beyond. Can you climb the ranks and become the ultimate freerunner? The Career Mode in Supermoves is a nostalgic thrill ride back to a more radical era. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5f916751ffdaf65addf2d92faf01e531.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5f916751ffdaf65addf2d92faf01e531.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5f916751ffdaf65addf2d92faf01e531.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Make Your Own Levels, Games &amp; More</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by the Makea Editor, every level is crafted using easy-to-place blocks, allowing you to assemble your ultimate parkour races, game shows, obstacle courses, or chill-out spots. Remix any level you find and play them online or offline \u2013 the editor can be booted up at any time, and you can use it with your friends online, simultaneously. Share your best levels and make it all your own \u2013 the sky\u2019s the limit! </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"This is Supermoves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/a3c3598ce58be75153193f39301c58a8abbca950.jpg"},{"name":"Back to School","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/ce00b33c3963ba592cd69dd5237010a40e530bdb.jpg"},{"name":"Wetwork","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/8362ac047b520eff06457920ad2244ade948e987.jpg"},{"name":"Made in Finland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/f18920b2a2ff9a86a2ab6f68619890f2e1039093.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Skater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/e1c6b5a494b9774cca88a094380f110bc89153b2.jpg"},{"name":"Make a Splash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/557eed79933c5a2c56dff7049c62b779891eb45c.jpg"},{"name":"A New York Minute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/22a2bb09c71368e43aa3e1a0ecf33f815c7b1291.jpg"},{"name":"The World Is Watching","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/4bf581c25e96a5226eab0e0ff59a52bd7c2bed9a.jpg"},{"name":"The Winner Takes It All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/95b8724b2073c05e1340252c15be0e09ba1414b4.jpg"},{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1959580/a69129d5bc3e2980692c5afe9fec9d642c862338.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1959580?t=1751306446","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751306446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/5b687fcf4892a3f52449c0cf4f8598860e799ac6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751306446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/5b687fcf4892a3f52449c0cf4f8598860e799ac6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751306446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>\u26a0\ufe0f Supermoves will be delisted from the Steam Store on June 30, 2025</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice: Supermoves will be delisted from the Steam Store on <strong>June 30, 2025</strong>. Online play and the Makea Editor will be unavailable after that date.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/4a0bc6440d31813c00992263f4a5dc26.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=114 /></span>Embark on a thrilling freerunning journey with Supermoves, the ultimate world of parkour that has a thrilling singleplayer Career Mode, speedrunning leaderboards and a multiplayer mode where you can face off against your friends in 8 gamemodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/c31866c21a2d0abfe9a92fb2732fe045.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/c31866c21a2d0abfe9a92fb2732fe045.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/c31866c21a2d0abfe9a92fb2732fe045.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>First &amp; Third Person Immersive Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through skylines with both first &amp; third person immersive parkour mechanics. Grind on your feet across rails, trapeze on high wires, wallrun, scramble, and pull off epic backflips and frontflips on trampolines. Supermoves combines arcade elements with thrilling immersive parkour freerunning. It's like Mirror's Edge meets Tony Hawk's Pro Skater!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5d1a05d057ff0c4b07c4c9086d9283e3.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=358 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d\u2708\ufe0f <strong>Brave The World of Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The epic Supermoves Championship awaits you in 10 exotic locales. There can only be one true winner. Can you make your way to the leaderboards? When you're done speedrunning, make your own levels with the easy to use Makea Editor - or remix any level in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/ee0f052dda414492008abc02315b9089.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/ee0f052dda414492008abc02315b9089.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/ee0f052dda414492008abc02315b9089.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Face Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your friends online in heart-stopping competitions, including braving the ever-rising ball pit in Rising Tide, the brutal Sprint and Circuit, or pulse-pounding Bomb Tag. Mix and match your experience in over 8 game modes, including the fan-favorite Obstacle Course and the nostalgic Loot mode. Chain them together into a playlist-based Royale or Tournament, eliminating the opposition to declare yourself the true winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/6e2a6c6bbcaa730a784a70fb85add219.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/6e2a6c6bbcaa730a784a70fb85add219.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/6e2a6c6bbcaa730a784a70fb85add219.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc5f\ud83e\udd47 <strong>Become the Ultimate Parkour Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supermoves features a full single-player Career Mode with classic goal maps, races and tournaments. Rise as a contender in the Supermoves Parkour Championships. Complete objectives in places like the School Gym, Rooftops, Plywood Park, Flatlands, and beyond. Can you climb the ranks and become the ultimate freerunner? The Career Mode in Supermoves is a nostalgic thrill ride back to a more radical era. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5f916751ffdaf65addf2d92faf01e531.poster.avif?t=1751306446\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5f916751ffdaf65addf2d92faf01e531.webm?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/extras/5f916751ffdaf65addf2d92faf01e531.mp4?t=1751306446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Make Your Own Levels, Games &amp; More</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by the Makea Editor, every level is crafted using easy-to-place blocks, allowing you to assemble your ultimate parkour races, game shows, obstacle courses, or chill-out spots. Remix any level you find and play them online or offline \u2013 the editor can be booted up at any time, and you can use it with your friends online, simultaneously. Share your best levels and make it all your own \u2013 the sky\u2019s the limit! </p>","developers":["Makea Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1959580/8d41e20cf88287ede1d1ae566da6ccc68e04a6b5/header.jpg?t=1751306446","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Makea Games Ltd. - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD Ryzen 3750x or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce RTX2060\u2122 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 or AMD Ryzen 5750x or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce RTX2070\u2122 Super or higher<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1959580/884352/602e237ecf00d3d61e6c5a204deaed7311b38e57/1751061377/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746415089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1959580/884352/602e237ecf00d3d61e6c5a204deaed7311b38e57/1751061377/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746415089","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1959580/884352/602e237ecf00d3d61e6c5a204deaed7311b38e57/1751061377/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746415089","